  "historyNote": "#4278, eff 6-30-87; ss by #5662, eff 7-1-93, EXPIRED: 7-1-99 New. #8414, eff 8-20-05 (formerly Env-Wr 401.04); ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
